<p class="lead"><strong>The Meridian Newsfolio</strong> is a digital newsroom and news archive. Our motto, <em>News Preserved. Stories Rediscovered.</em>, describes what we do: we report the news, and we keep every story so it can be found again.</p>

<h2>What we cover</h2>
<p>We publish news from Bangladesh and from around the world on politics, business, technology, education, sports, entertainment, health, the environment and science. Stories appear in English and in Bangla.</p>

<h2>How our newsroom works</h2>
<p>Authors write and submit stories, and an editor reviews each one before publication. Nothing written by an author appears on the site until an editor has approved it. Read our <a href="/editorial-policy">editorial policy</a> to learn more about how we report, review and correct stories.</p>

<h2>An archive you can search</h2>
<p>Every published story stays in the archive. Search by keyword and date, browse by section, or follow our RSS feed.</p>

<h2>Get in touch</h2>
<p>Have a tip, a correction or feedback? Visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
